Third-party components (fetched or used at build time; none is vendored
into this repository's sources):

Build and runtime dependencies
- nlohmann/json v3.12.0 (commit 55f93686c015), MIT. Fetched with CMake
  FetchContent for ekf_sim, ekf_cli and the WASM module (not used by
  ekf_core).
- Emscripten SDK 7.0.0, MIT / University of Illinois NCSA (dual). Its
  generated JavaScript glue (web/public/ekf.js) and runtime libraries are
  linked into the WASM demo bundle.

Test and development tools (not distributed in the library)
- GoogleTest v1.18.0 (commit 063de7e9578f), BSD-3-Clause. Fetched with
  FetchContent for native (non-WASM) builds; linked only into the tests.
- Node.js 26.13.0, MIT (CI runtime for the web build).
- TypeScript 7.0.2, Apache-2.0.
- Vite 8.3.7, MIT.
- Vitest 5.1.0, MIT.
- @playwright/test 1.65.0, Apache-2.0 (with Chromium from Playwright).
- @types/node 22.13.4, MIT.

ROS 2 Humble demo (`ros2/ekf_gnss_demo`; not required for native tests). Versions
are from the `ros:humble-ros-base-jammy` image used in `ros2-humble.yml` (Debian
packages as recorded in CI apt logs):
- rclcpp (`ros-humble-rclcpp` 16.0.12-1jammy), Apache-2.0
- ament_cmake (`ros-humble-ament-cmake` 1.3.11-1jammy), Apache-2.0
- launch (`ros-humble-launch` 1.0.15-1jammy) and launch_ros
  (`ros-humble-launch-ros` 0.19.14-1jammy), Apache-2.0
- launch_testing (`ros-humble-launch-testing` 1.0.15-1jammy),
  launch_testing_ament_cmake (`ros-humble-launch-testing-ament-cmake`
  1.0.15-1jammy), launch_testing_ros (`ros-humble-launch-testing-ros`
  0.19.14-1jammy), Apache-2.0
- nav_msgs (`ros-humble-nav-msgs` 4.2.3-1jammy), BSD-3-Clause
- sensor_msgs (`ros-humble-sensor-msgs` 4.2.3-1jammy), BSD-3-Clause
- geometry_msgs (`ros-humble-geometry-msgs` 4.2.3-1jammy), BSD-3-Clause
- std_msgs (`ros-humble-std-msgs` 4.2.3-1jammy), BSD-3-Clause
`robot_localization` is not used in this repository.

